/**
 * Provider registry.
 *
 * HARD RULE: capabilities are declared explicitly by the user. The system
 * NEVER infers a capability from a model name (e.g. "…Video" does not imply
 * video_generation, and "multimodal" does not imply voice_cloning), and never
 * assumes OpenAI-compatible endpoints are fully compatible. Each protocol
 * has its own adapter.
 */

